     #For my final loop I will make nested loop.

for outer_number in range(1, 8):
    for inner_number in range(1, 8):
        #Print the outer and inner number
        print("Outer:", outer_number, "Inner:", inner_number)
# its basically a loop inside of a loop. The outer loop will run 7 times, and for each time the outer loop runs, the inner loop will run 7 times. So in total, the inner loop will run 49 times (7 * 7 = 49).